msgid "版本发布策略"
msgstr "Version Release Strategy"

msgid "版本编号"
msgstr "Version Number"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 遵循 [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) 版本规范，版本号与上游 Triton 对齐：`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend follows the [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) versioning specification and aligns its version numbers with upstream Triton: `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"

msgid "**MAJOR.MINOR**：与上游 Triton 版本一一对应，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2` 基于 Triton `3.2`"
msgstr "**MAJOR.MINOR**: Corresponds one-to-one with the upstream Triton version. For example, Triton-Ascend `3.2` is based on Triton `3.2`."

msgid "**PATCH**：Triton-Ascend 的 `PATCH` 版本可能高于上游 Triton，用于 `MAJOR.MINOR` 级别的问题修复或改进，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` 和 `3.2.1` 均基于 Triton `3.2.0`"
msgstr "**PATCH**: The `PATCH` version of Triton-Ascend may be higher than that of the upstream Triton. It is used for issue fixes or improvements at the `MAJOR.MINOR` level. For example, both Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` and `3.2.1` are based on Triton `3.2.0`."

msgid "**rcN**：发布候选版本，根据需要发布以供社区早期测试和反馈"
msgstr "**rcN**: Release candidate version, released as needed for early testing and feedback from the community."

msgid "**postN**：已发布版本的后续补丁，根据需要发布以修复稳定版本中的问题"
msgstr "**postN**: A follow-up patch for a released version, issued as needed to fix issues in stable versions"

msgid "分支策略"
msgstr "Branch strategy"

msgid "`main` 分支为最新开发分支，跟踪最新上游 Triton 版本"
msgstr "The `main` branch is the latest development branch and tracks the latest upstream Triton version."

msgid "每个发布版本创建对应的发布开发分支（如 `release/3.2.x`），与社区发布具有相同的 commit id"
msgstr "Create a corresponding release development branch for each release version (for example, `release/3.2.x`) with the same commit id as the community release."

msgid "功能开发应在 fork 仓库中进行，通过 `PR` 合入 Triton-Ascend 仓库"
msgstr "Develop features in a forked repository, and merge them into the Triton-Ascend repository through a `PR`."

msgid "维护分支与生命周期"
msgstr "Maintenance Branches and Lifecycle"

msgid "维护分支状态包括："
msgstr "Maintenance branch statuses include:"

msgid "**活跃（Active）**：持续接受缺陷修复、功能改进和安全补丁；将继续演进功能或发布新版本"
msgstr "**Active**: It continuously receives bug fixes, feature improvements, and security patches; it will continue to evolve features or release new versions."

msgid "**维护（Maintenance）**：仅接受关键缺陷修复和安全补丁；不再发布功能改进"
msgstr "**Maintenance**: Only critical bug fixes and security patches are accepted; feature improvements are no longer released."

msgid "**停止维护（End of Life）**：不再接受任何修复；分支维护已停止"
msgstr "**End of Life**: No fixes are accepted; branch maintenance has stopped."

