msgid "**稳定版本**：按照项目版本节奏发布，并非每个上游 Triton 版本都会有对应的稳定发布"
msgstr "**Stable version**: Released according to the project release cadence. Not every upstream Triton version has a corresponding stable release."

msgid "**rc 版本**：与上游 Triton 版本节奏同步发布，供用户早期测试"
msgstr "**rc version**: The rc version is released in sync with the upstream Triton version schedule for early user testing."

msgid "**post 版本**：根据需要发布，用于修复现有稳定版本中的问题"
msgstr "**post version**: Released as needed to fix issues in the existing stable version."

